### Test if server is running
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Create a new room
POST http://localhost:5000/api/rooms/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomName": "Dubai Trip 2024",
  "roomType": "trip",
  "createdBy": {
    "userId": "john123",
    "name": "John Doe",
    "email": "john@example.com"
  },
  "currency": "AED"
}

### Join the room (Replace ABC123 with the roomCode from above response)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/rooms/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomCode": "ABC123",
  "userId": "jane456",
  "userName": "Jane Smith",
  "userEmail": "jane@example.com"
}

### Get room details (Replace ABC123 with actual room code)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/rooms/ABC123

### Add expense to room
POST http://localhost:5000/api/rooms/ABC123/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Dinner at restaurant",
  "amount": 300,
  "paidBy": "john123",
  "splitBetween": ["john123", "jane456"]
}

### List all rooms (for debugging)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/rooms
